#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:5 c8750d5f720b47d387d380b73a2b744d
msgid "Radio Control"
msgstr "无线电控制"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:7 1df6c82baab942ab971793a4dcf0b348
msgid ""
"Due to the RF attenuation of even a short distance of water above a "
"submersible, radio control must be accomplished by floating tethered buoy to"
" the vehicle which contains the RF components and antenna. This applies also"
" to RF based telemetry, whether independent of, or integrated into, the "
"radio control system."
msgstr ""
"由于即使潜水载具上方只有很浅的水层也会造成射频衰减，无线电控制必须通过系留于载具的水面浮标实现，浮标中装有射频组件和天线。这同样适用于基于射频的数传，无论其独立于遥控系统还是集成于其中。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:9 209280dbc91d4a698f9a134df0de5300
msgid ""
"To enable radio control, the :ref:`RC_PROTOCOLS<RC_PROTOCOLS>` parameter "
"must be set to a non-zero value, \"1\" is usually used. If rc control of the"
" flight mode is desired, in addition to axis/directional control, the "
":ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` should be set to the RC channel that will "
"control flight modes, if this is desired."
msgstr ""
"要启用无线电控制，必须将 :ref:`RC_PROTOCOLS<RC_PROTOCOLS>` 参数设置为非零值，通常使用 "
"「1」。若需要通过遥控控制飞行模式（除轴/方向控制外），应将 :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` "
"设置为将控制飞行模式的遥控通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:11 aa6d3c2a72e3407487b977581c9918eb
msgid ""
"Any ArduPilot compatible :ref:`radio control system<common-rc-systems>` can "
"be employed."
msgstr "可使用任何与 ArduPilot 兼容的 :ref:`无线电控制系统<common-rc-systems>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:14 a06a5f863bf74d41878ab86e37ce6977
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:16 65c9c1048e8f4ca0be732fc6f16aae54
msgid ""
"The mapping of which incoming RC channel controls which axis/directional "
"control is fixed when GCS only control is used, however, these can be "
"remapped using :ref:`common-rcmap`."
msgstr "仅使用地面站控制时，遥控通道与轴/方向控制的映射是固定的，但可通过 :ref:`common-rcmap` 重新映射。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:18 6a5d913ffd00459e808852fdf99de6a0
msgid ""
"If a flight mode switch is used, it can be setup as following :ref:`common-"
"rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration`."
msgstr ""
"若使用飞行模式开关，可按照 :ref:`common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration` 进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:20 1e03a74dce294047a04b91d0820a1b49
msgid ""
"In place of the Sub ``BTNx`` functions activated from the GCS, :ref:`common-"
"auxiliary-functions` can be setup, controlled via RC transmitter switches."
msgstr ""
"作为地面站激活的 Sub ``BTNx`` 功能的替代，可以设置 :ref:`common-auxiliary-"
"functions`，通过遥控发射机开关进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:23 d97d63f0c95f4c459fa80c0ede863a84
msgid "Mandatory Calibration"
msgstr "必要校准"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:24 0f589b5c28ea43eb9f21c2df3c0aab72
msgid ""
"Once the rc receiver is attached to the autopilot and configured as "
"described in :ref:`common-rc-systems` it must be calibrated:"
msgstr "一旦遥控接收机连接到飞控并按 :ref:`common-rc-systems` 所述配置完毕，必须进行校准："

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:26 d76c62a18adb4d558e338b741eb86af0
msgid ":ref:`common-radio-control-calibration`"
msgstr ":ref:`common-radio-control-calibration`"
